Baker: "I don’t have any flour left… I have no idea what I will bake from."
Vesper: "What happened to the flour you were getting from the trade ships in the trading docks?"
Baker: "You didn’t hear? Angels laid siege on the fortress of the Wolves up north. The whole region is destabilized and pirates are raiding trade ships. It will take months for the waters to be safe again."
